## Import

Import a workspace by its Claude Tag ID (`slws_...`), which `anthropic_claude_tag_slack_workspaces` lists:

```shell
terraform import anthropic_claude_tag_slack_workspace_settings.main slws_011CZkZnWa7xPc3uJfZe5LgT
```
